  (text "POWER INPUT\nThe main board runs from 5 V. The 9-36 V -> 5.3 V converter is a plug-on PSU board (hour-meter-psu-b) on J102;\nthe vehicle wire stays on J101. Alternative: feed 5.3 V from an LM2596 module into J102 pins 3/4 (GND on 2/5).\nJ102 pinout is 180-degree safe: 1 VIN, 2 GND, 3 +5V_PSU, 4 +5V_PSU, 5 GND, 6 VIN.\nUSB VBUS is OR-ed into +5V on the esp32-core sheet. VIN_SENSE = VIN x 5.6/105.6 (GPIO34, ADC1_CH6).\nH101 = PSU standoff; H102-H105 = board corner holes."
    (at 25 25 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "a3d2eb0b-3179-4624-9778-23512ae8bb20")
  )
